Form Validation

1. To add manditory    (required)
2. type="password"  type="email"  @
3. input type="submit"  -->Validation possible

how to set pattern in email,password then phone

1. Password Pattern: pattern="(?=.*\d)(?=.*[a-z])(?=.*[A-Z]).{6,}"  

2. Email Pattern:  pattern="[a-z0-9._%+-]+@[a-z0-9.-]+\.[a-z]{2,}$"

3. Phone number:  pattern="\d{10}"